msgstr "Ёзишга рухсат йўқ"

#: kio/global.cpp:710
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to write to the file <strong>%1</strong> was "
"rejected."
msgstr "Бу <strong>%1</strong> файлига ёзиш рад этилганлигини билдиради."

#: kio/global.cpp:717
msgid "Unable to Enter Folder"
msgstr "Жилдга ўтиб бўлмади"

#: kio/global.cpp:718
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This means that an attempt to enter (in other words, to open) the requested "
"folder <strong>%1</strong> was rejected."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:726
msgid "Folder Listing Unavailable"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:727
#, kde-format
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filesystem"
msgstr "Протокол %1 файл тизими эмас"

#: kio/global.cpp:728
msgid ""
"This means that a request was made which requires determining the contents "
"of the folder, and the KDE program supporting this protocol is unable to do "
"so."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:736
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected"
msgstr "Чексиз боғ топилди"

#: kio/global.cpp:737
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or folder to a separate "
"name and/or location. KDE detected a link or series of links that results in "
"an infinite loop - i.e. the file was (perhaps in a roundabout way) linked to "
"itself."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:741 kio/global.cpp:763
msgid ""
"Delete one part of the loop in order that it does not cause an infinite "
"loop, and try again."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:750
msgid "Request Aborted By User"
msgstr "Талаб фойдаланувчи томонидан тўхтатилди"

#: kio/global.cpp:751 kio/global.cpp:1052
msgid "The request was not completed because it was aborted."
msgstr "Талаб охирига етказилмади. Чунки у тўхтатилди."

#: kio/global.cpp:753 kio/global.cpp:947 kio/global.cpp:1054
msgid "Retry the request."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:757
msgid "Cyclic Link Detected During Copy"
msgstr "Нусха олаётганда чексиз боғ топилди"

#: kio/global.cpp:758
msgid ""
"UNIX environments are commonly able to link a file or folder to a separate "
"name and/or location. During the requested copy operation, KDE detected a "
"link or series of links that results in an infinite loop - i.e. the file was "
"(perhaps in a roundabout way) linked to itself."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:768
msgid "Could Not Create Network Connection"
msgstr "Тармоқ орқали уланишни яратиб бўлмади"

#: kio/global.cpp:769
msgid "Could Not Create Socket"
msgstr "Сокетни яратиб бўлмади"

#: kio/global.cpp:770
msgid ""
"This is a fairly technical error in which a required device for network "
"communications (a socket) could not be created."
msgstr ""
"Бу техник хато. Тармоқ орқали алоқа учун воситани (сокет) яратиб бўлмади."

#: kio/global.cpp:772 kio/global.cpp:885 kio/global.cpp:896 kio/global.cpp:905
msgid ""
"The network connection may be incorrectly configured, or the network "
"interface may not be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Тармоқ нотўғри мосланган ёки тармоқ интерфейси ёқилмаган бўлиши мумкин."

#: kio/global.cpp:778
msgid "Connection to Server Refused"
msgstr "Боғланиш сервер томонидан рад этилди"

#: kio/global.cpp:779
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The server <strong>%1</strong> refused to allow this computer to make a "
"connection."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:781
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be configured "
"to allow requests."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:783
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The server, while currently connected to the Internet, may not be running "
"the requested service (%1)."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:785
msgid ""
"A network firewall (a device which restricts Internet requests), either "
"protecting your network or the network of the server, may have intervened, "
"preventing this request."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:792
msgid "Connection to Server Closed Unexpectedly"
msgstr "Сервер билан алоқа кутилмаганда узилди"

#: kio/global.cpp:793
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Although a connection was established to <strong>%1</strong>, the connection "
"was closed at an unexpected point in the communication."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:796
msgid ""
"A protocol error may have occurred, causing the server to close the "
"connection as a response to the error."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:802
msgid "URL Resource Invalid"
msgstr "URL манбаси хато"

#: kio/global.cpp:803
#, kde-format
msgid "Protocol %1 is not a Filter Protocol"
msgstr "Протокол %1 филтер протоколи эмас"

#: kio/global.cpp:804
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The <strong>U</strong>niform <strong>R</strong>esource <strong>L</"
"strong>ocator (URL) that you entered did not refer to a valid mechanism of "
"accessing the specific resource, <strong>%1%2</strong>."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:809
msgid ""
"KDE is able to communicate through a protocol within a protocol. This "
"request specified a protocol be used as such, however this protocol is not "
"capable of such an action. This is a rare event, and is likely to indicate a "
"programming error."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:817
msgid "Unable to Initialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:818
msgid "Could Not Mount Device"
msgstr "Ускунани улаб бўлмади"

#: kio/global.cpp:819
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be initialized (\"mounted\"). The reported "
"error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:822
msgid ""
"The device may not be ready, for example there may be no media in a "
"removable media device (i.e. no CD-ROM in a CD drive), or in the case of a "
"peripheral/portable device, the device may not be correctly connected."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:826
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to initialize (\"mount\") the device. On UNIX "
"systems, often system administrator privileges are required to initialize a "
"device."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:830
msgid ""
"Check that the device is ready; removable drives must contain media, and "
"portable devices must be connected and powered on.; and try again."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:836
msgid "Unable to Uninitialize Input/Output Device"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:837
msgid "Could Not Unmount Device"
msgstr "Ускунани ажратиб бўлмади"

#: kio/global.cpp:838
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The requested device could not be uninitialized (\"unmounted\"). The "
"reported error was: <strong>%1</strong>"
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:841
msgid ""
"The device may be busy, that is, still in use by another application or "
"user. Even such things as having an open browser window on a location on "
"this device may cause the device to remain in use."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:845
msgid ""
"You may not have permissions to uninitialize (\"unmount\") the device. On "
"UNIX systems, system administrator privileges are often required to "
"uninitialize a device."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:849
msgid "Check that no applications are accessing the device, and try again."
msgstr ""

#: kio/global.cpp:854
msgid "Cannot Read From Resource"
msgstr "Манбадан ўқиб бўлмади"

#: kio/global.cpp:855
#, kde-format
msgid ""
